","textMapHash":3051594578,"text":"要らない！今日は普通の料理が食べたいんだ！ジュリー、彼女を止めろ！","nextNodeIds":[728000315]},{"nodeId":728000315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20270,"speakerName":"パルヴァネ","textMapHash":1049418922,"text":"ふん、見る目がないのね…まあいい、もう少し改良してみるわ。絶対にどんな料理でも入れるだけで美味しくなる万能調味料を作ってみせる。","nextNodeIds":[728000316]},{"nodeId":728000316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20268,"speakerName":"旭東","textMapHash":3580676514,"text":"万能調味料…そんなもの作れるのか…","nextNodeIds":[728000317]},{"nodeId":728000317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20270,"speakerName":"パルヴァネ","textMapHash":4152095242,"text":"誰も作っていないからこそ、私が作って見せるの。そうすれば、教令院の頭の固い奴らをびっくりさせられる。","nextNodeIds":[728000318]},{"nodeId":728000318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20268,"speakerName":"旭東","textMapHash":1634857554,"text":"はは…いいぞ、楽しみにしている。","nextNodeIds":[728000319]},{"nodeId":728000319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20268,"speakerName":"旭東","textMapHash":30472378,"text":"そうだ、旅人。長い時間付き合ってくれて、ご苦労だった。","nextNodeIds":[728000320]},{"nodeId":728000320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20268,"speakerName":"旭東","textMapHash":3488911434,"text":"料理を持ち帰れるようにしてやるよ。外で冒険するなら、お腹いっぱいにしておかないとな。","nextNodeIds":[728000321]},{"nodeId":728000321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20268,"speakerName":"旭東","textMapHash":1582032090,"text":"次回会う時は、必ず美味しい料理をご馳走するよ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":728000306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3458793386,"text":"また今度食べにくる。","nextNodeIds":[728000307]},{"nodeId":728000307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20268,"speakerName":"旭東","textMapHash":1026433898,"text":"ははっ、よし、約束だぞ。最高の料理を作ってやる。","nextNodeIds":[728000308]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7280003,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133209005","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133209004","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREG